---
title: Fajita Vegetables
image: https://cookingmadehealthy.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/02/Fajita-Vegetables-2.jpg
cook time: 5 minutes
servings: 6
source: https://cookingmadehealthy.com/fajita-vegetables/#wprm-recipe-container-30833
time required: 15 minutes
prep time: 10 minutes
---

Add @canola oil{1%tbsp} to a #cast iron skillet{} on high heat.

Add @bell peppers{4}(thinly sliced), @red onion{1}(thinly sliced), and @garlic{2%cloves}(minced) and let cook for ~{3%minutes} before stirring, then an additional ~{2%minutes}.

Add in @cumin{1%tsp}, @chili powder{1%tsp}, @salt{3/4%tsp}, @paprika{1/2%tsp}, and @dried oregano{1/2%tsp} and stir.

Remove from the heat and serve.